' Bundle-local PlantUML library, ``!include``-d by needuml.rst and
' needarch.rst. PlantUML resolves ``!include`` against its own working
' directory, which Sphinx-Needs derives from the *source file* of the
' including document -- so this file is found whether the bundle is mounted
' from an external tree or copied into the host srcdir.
'
' Requires sphinx-needs > 8.3.0. Earlier versions derived that working
' directory from the logical docname, which does not exist on disk for a
' mounted document, and the build failed with the misleading
' "plantuml command '...' cannot be run".
' See https://github.com/useblocks/sphinx-needs/issues/1749.

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "SHOWCASE_NEEDS_PUML_INCLUDE" as BundleLibrary
